Subject: [PATCH 2/2] U04 review: contents card's closed summary is a 44px
 target; note the ESV text-edition line

The contents card now starts closed on a phone, so its summary is the only
way in, and it was a single 18.7px line of 11px text. The card's padding
moves onto the summary (and the list), so the whole closed card is the tap
target (50.7px) and the card looks the same open or closed.

esv.ts records that search results show Crossway's current notice ending
with 'ESV Text Edition: 2025.'; it is not added until James pastes the page.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JuCQ8kZ25i9zRwNgk6bh4e
